    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0777",
      "reading_order": 870,
      "section": "Pressure Switch",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.5,
        "t": 501.47200000000004,
        "r": 158.98000000000002,
        "b": 489.29936134453783
      },
      "content": "Pressure Switch",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0778",
      "reading_order": 871,
      "section": "Pressure Switch",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.5,
        "t": 471.68,
        "r": 296.74999999999994,
        "b": 444.07210084033613
      },
      "content": "The pressure switch is an overfill safety device mounted on the base located on the right front. A clear plastic tube (the pressure switch hose) runs from the switch to the sump."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0779",
      "reading_order": 872,
      "section": "Pressure Switch",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.5,
        "t": 438.68,
        "r": 309.9595999999999,
        "b": 381.07210084033613
      },
      "content": "As the dishwasher tub fills with water, the air pressure in the pressure switch hose increases. Normally, the control board regulates the amount of time the water fill valve remains open. If the water fill valve remains energized, the overfilling of the tub increases the air pressure in the pressure hose causing the pressure switch to close and energize the drain pump."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0780",
      "reading_order": 873,
      "section": "Pressure Switch",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.5,
        "t": 362.68,
        "r": 301.34,
        "b": 335.07210084033613
      },
      "content": "This test will check the wiring to the pressure switch and the pressure switch itself. The following items are part of the pressure switch circuit."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0781",
      "reading_order": 874,
      "section": "Pressure Switch",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.5,
        "t": 330.90000000000003,
        "r": 150.32,
        "b": 321.5903225806452
      },
      "content": "  Harness/Connection"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0782",
      "reading_order": 875,
      "section": "Pressure Switch",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.5,
        "t": 317.90000000000003,
        "r": 131.33,
        "b": 308.5903225806452
      },
      "content": "  Pressure Switch"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0783",
      "reading_order": 876,
      "section": "Pressure Switch",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.5,
        "t": 304.90000000000003,
        "r": 153.98,
        "b": 295.5903225806452
      },
      "content": "  Pressure Switch Hose"
    },
    {
